# Test of the journal's quest count for a plan's story islands (CIPlay qc5_quest_count, in a test world 'CI ...';
# TEST_CATALOGUE QC5): The Long Voyage from its start - its story islands and its side trips are counted before they
# come; the story count goes up when Wreckers' Cove's quest is done; a side trip sailed to and played.
plan The Long Voyage
note RadioTower
expect chain RadioTower unlocked
expect quests 0 sidetrips

note Vasagatan
expect chain cove unlocked
tune cove
include wreckers_cove.play
expect chain cove done
expect quests 1 sidetrips

sail 2
arrive gull
include stranded_gull.play
expect quests 1 sidetrips
plan end
